@lam/jobs is a Lammergeier third-party library for PostgreSQL-backed leases,
job scheduling, job health, instance heartbeats and durable job queues. It
uses no Go modules beyond those linked by the Lammergeier standard library:
the PostgreSQL driver github.com/lib/pq (used through lamdb and for
LISTEN/NOTIFY) is distributed under its own MIT license by its authors.
